WEBVTT

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.100
<i>Of all things...</i>

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.480
<i>I never thought I'd be in the 
same room as these girls.</i>

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.150
<i>How will I explain what happened yesterday?</i>

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:16.350
Gulp...

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.040
Didn't I Say to Make My Abilities 
Average in the Next Life?!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.040
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.040
<b>Didn't I Say the Four of Us Would Be a Party?!</b>

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.920
We should start with introductions.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.550
Huh?

00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:00.350
I am Mavis von Austien, aged seventeen.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.060
I come from a family of knights 
and aim to become a swordswoman.

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.270
Reina. I'm fifteen.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:09.060
I'm a mage, Hunter rank E, 
and people call me "Crimson Reina."

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:12.190
Oh! She gave herself the 
"Crimson Reina" nickname again!

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.620
So you really aren't an 
F-rank beginner, then.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:16.520
Well, no.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:19.110
Oh! I'm hoping to become a mage, too.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:23.120
Pauline. I'm fourteen,
 and my family are merchants.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.660
Reina-san, I hope to learn a 
lot from you, if you don't mind.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.060
In that case, you're asking the wrong person.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:29.870
Right?

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.130
Huh?

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.160
Introductions. It's your turn.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.500
Oh, uh, right!

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.930
Um... I'm Mile. Twelve years old.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.300
Your profession and rank?

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.930
I-I-I hope to become a 
mage and my r-rank is...

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.330
<i>Maybe C?</i>

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.560
<i>Somewhere around B...</i>

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.520
<i>It couldn't be A, could it?</i>

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.740
My rank is a rock-bottom F!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.020
I'm a novice Hunter!

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:56.550
<i>That's a lie!</i>

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.780
<i>They don't believe me!</i>

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.530
<i>Could it be... at this rate...</i>

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.030
<b>Objection!</b>

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:03.030
<i>Will they put me on trial?</i>

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.040
<i>Have a space-time inquest?</i>

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.620
<i>It couldn't be torture, could it?</i>

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.870
To try to uncover my secrets...

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.460
You. Tell us the truth—

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:17.630
It's time. We should go.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.150
I guess so.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.760
Mile-chan, you should come, too.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.890
Um... Where?

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.470
We'll be late to the new student orientation.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.300
Oh, that's right.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.670
<i>Thank goodness. I managed 
to dodge that somehow.</i>

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:32.730
Huh?

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.730
<i>Maybe I didn't dodge it.</i>

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.490
I am Elbert, the school principal.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:47.720
I'm here to cram what you would normally 
learn over the course of several years

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.750
of your own experiences into six months.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.490
The training will be brutal.

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:54.570
But if you manage to graduate, 
you'll be awarded a D rank.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:57.580
Whoa! That's amazing! He said D rank!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:01.300
And... the student with the highest 
scores will be awarded C rank.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.570
Wow! Yay!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:06.880
<i>I have to make sure no one 
finds out what I really am.</i>

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.690
<i>Especially not those three.</i>

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.060
First, you'll show me what you can do.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:22.740
Hold there!

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:25.700
You're pretty skilled, Mavis.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.950
Thank you, sir.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:28.680
Right. Next pair!

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.020
Y-Yes, sir!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:35.000
<i>This time, I'll be normal. 
I'll make this average.</i>

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.460
<i>I'd like to be about fifth from the top.</i>

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.750
<i>I'll just do whatever and lose quickly.</i>

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.850
Look at who she's up against.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:44.260
Yeah, Moob. He's already an active Hunter.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.970
I heard he choked an orc to 
death with his bare hands.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:51.870
<i>Just do whatever and lose quickly. 
Just do whatever and lose quickly...</i>

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.980
<i>And if possible, lose in
 a way that doesn't hurt.</i>

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.480
<i>I'm a girl who can be average!</i>

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.200
Bah! With a girl like this as my opponent, 
forget interesting. This'll be nothing.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.340
I-I'm looking forward to a good bout!

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:08.160
Hey! If I'm gonna be fighting little girls, 
I'd rather have that one over there.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.860
This one's flat as a cutting board!
 No fun at all!

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:12.410
What?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.260
Huh?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.210
I'll destroy you!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.970
My chest? You're talking about <i>my</i> chest?

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.870
Is it such a crime to be flat?

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.380
She took out Moob with one blow!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.120
Could you see any of that?

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.430
No, I couldn't follow it at all.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.180
N-N-No! It's not what you think!

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:35.720
He said his stomach hurt, 
and then he just fell over!

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:38.020
I'm even more curious about you now.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.360
He just fell over! I'm telling the truth!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.510
Mile-chan is really amazing, isn't she?

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.940
Those weren't the moves of 
someone applying to be a mage.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.530
What is with that girl?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.010
Fly, flames!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.960
All right, next! Reina!

00:05:58.680 --> 00:05:59.340
Yes, sir!

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.590
Blaze brightly, fires of hell!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.880
Burn through even the bones!

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.420
That's some pretty good magic.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:12.470
Thank you.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.240
Right, next. Mile.

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.560
Y-Yes, sir!

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.970
<i>Average, average...</i>

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.900
<i>This time... This time for sure,
 I'll be average.</i>

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.820
<i>If I use about half the 
magic Reina-san used...</i>

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.920
<i>I won't get it wrong this time.</i>

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.680
Blaze brightly, fires of hell.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.200
Burn through even the bones!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:34.710
Perfect!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:39.770
Reina-san?

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.170
You're not bad.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.280
Oh, no. I'm totally normal.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.080
You saw my magic just now, right?

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.710
Yes. I saw it.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.640
You used my original spell, magic that only I should be able to use,

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.970
after seeing it only once.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.720
Original spell?

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.480
You're going to explain how you did it.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.200
I just remembered something I need to do.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.260
If you'll excuse me!

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.490
I did it again...

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.760
There, there, Mile-sama. 
It happens all the time, doesn't it?

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.200
You could help me a little...

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.620
You're so mean, Nano-chan.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.500
Those are my specs.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:19.580
Oh, hey.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.760
Isn't this the perfect time
to do that one thing?

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.080
Oh, right!

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:27.880
Just a little more and it'll be done!

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:31.930
It's done!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.110
Listen to this, Marcelina!

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:36.680
Though it's a little hard for me to say...

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.300
Listen to this, Marcelina!

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:42.520
I want to live a normal life, but...

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.690
I just can't seem to do it!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:50.440
Thank you for listening, Marcelina!

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.950
What an unusual doll.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:58.360
Oh, this is an SD figure. 
Sort of a Nendonaroid.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:02.580
By reducing the overall proportions, 
its cuteness is accented...

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.580
Huh?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.340
Um, how long have you been there?

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:09.720
Listen to this, Marcelina!

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.010
From around there.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.090
<i>She heard the whole thing!</i>

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.480
It really is very cute.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:17.010
Th-Thanks...

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.640
Where did you learn such a skill?

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:19.510
Huh?

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:21.640
<i>I took something I loved in my last life...</i>

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.390
<i>And just made what I remembered.</i>

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:27.150
<i>But there's no way I can say that!</i>

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.540
Stare...

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:33.150
<i>She's watching me! Staring at me!
 What do I do? What do I do?</i>

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.530
It...

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:36.660
It?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.410
It's a secret family technique!

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.380
Oh, is it?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.010
Yes, it is!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.000
<i>Good! I managed to dodge the question!</i>

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.360
<i>I'm sure that's what she's thinking now.</i>

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:56.690
Actually, Mile-chan,
I came to invite you to tea.

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:57.890
Tea?

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:03.870
<i>My first day at the academy,
and I'm already going to a RL event!</i>

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.450
You are going to tell us about yourself.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.700
<i>This tea set is starting to look
 like a police station katsudon...</i>

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:25.520
U-Um... I'm really just a 
super-normal twelve-year-old.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.460
Even though you defeated the 
Hunter Moob with a single blow?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.380
It's a secret family technique.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.750
Even though you used magic only I can use?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.470
It was a secret family technique...

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.640
I told you, I invented that spell!

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:39.680
Reina-san, please don't look so angry.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.810
After all, we're not trying 
to pick on Mile-chan.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:49.640
We just want to learn more about each other 
to get better acquainted. That's all.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:51.190
Yes, that's true.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:55.070
Since we went to the trouble, I suppose 
we should have some tea and sweets.

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:58.530
It seems like we have a 
long night ahead of us.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.910
<i>There's no escaping this!</i>

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.020
<i>There's only one option left.</i>

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.710
All right! I'll tell you!

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:13.640
So, you're saying that a cabinet minister after
 your abilities allied with a demon lord,

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:17.530
and you were able to escape unscathed 
with the help of a prince?

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:18.440
Yes!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.750
I thought I was going to die!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.720
I see. That must have been tough.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.100
It really was!

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:27.390
And who d'you think is 
gonna believe that, moron?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.090
What?

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:31.740
I've read that book, too!

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:32.680
Oh no!

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:34.480
It <i>is</i> a bestseller.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.080
Are you mocking us?

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:40.760
That wasn't my intention at all. Not at all.

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:43.100
Then tell us the truth!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.160
What?

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.790
Now, now. Let's leave it there for now.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.950
What? Why? You're curious too, aren't you?

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.630
I am curious, but...

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:55.420
Everyone has something in their past 
they'd rather not talk about, right?

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:58.170
Well, yes, but...

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.260
Huh? I don't.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.380
I have things I'd rather not talk about, too.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:07.890
Which is why...

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:12.290
I hope you'll want to tell us one 
day, when we're better friends.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.810
Pauline-san...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.080
I'm sorry for trying to force you to tell us.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.680
I'm looking forward to getting to know you.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:18.570
Reina-san!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:23.090
I'm not sure what you're saying, but...

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.980
Thank you, everyone!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:31.600
<i>I'm sure the doll Mile-chan 
made would sell very well.</i>

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.810
<i>It doesn't seem like she's any good at lying, 
so she's probably not a bad person.</i>

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:38.600
<i>But I'm going to make her tell 
me the secret of her strength!</i>

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:41.230
<i>Still...</i>

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:45.200
<i>For her to think she could fool us with 
the plot from that popular novel...</i>

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.700
<i>Is she... a ditz?</i>

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.120
Next, you'll show me your 
strength in the field.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:59.090
I've posted quests even you should be 
able to clear on the bulletin board.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.140
Form parties and complete them within a week.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.630
What do you think?

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:06.740
Who would be good?

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.720
Parties, huh?

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:14.250
Stare...

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:16.570
Well, shall we go?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:19.120
If we don't hurry, all the 
good ones will be gone.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.380
With these four members, 
our party's complete!

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:23.690
Y-Yes!

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:28.890
Defeating ten horned 
rabbits clears this quest.

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:32.090
Those are the lowest-ranked monsters.
 It should be simple.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.520
But...

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:36.180
Where could they be?

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.620
Leave it to me!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.470
There's one in the brush!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.320
There really was one!

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.700
How did you know that?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.840
It was just a little search magic.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.560
Seriously, what are you?

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:56.440
The quest is more important right now!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.540
We'll start with one!

00:12:58.760 --> 00:12:59.800
It's fast!

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:01.710
With my magic, I'll—

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.720
It takes too long to aim!

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:05.940
I'll do it!

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:07.590
Oh dear!

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.140
They're so fast.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.390
There's no way we're getting ten of those.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.470
Do you think we aren't ready for this yet?

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.460
Is this the first time you've 
done a quest like this?

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.650
I've trained with the sword, though.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:24.240
It's my first time, too.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.320
I'm not good at hitting 
targets that keep moving.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.160
I see.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.750
<i>I can defeat them myself, but...</i>

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.840
<i>But there's no point in that.</i>

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.760
Laugh and have fun... Laugh and have fun...

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:38.170
Wha...

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.250
What are you doing?

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.170
I've got it!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.550
Everyone! Do you want to get stronger?

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.340
Huh?

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.800
Gather, water!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.040
Come to me!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.670
Now, squeeze the water together tightly.

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:57.340
Horned rabbits are small and agile,

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.000
so we'll make this sphere small, too.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.810
Try to imagine something 
you can move quickly.

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:02.570
Freeze!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.360
Change form!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.820
Sharpen into an icicle!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:06.960
Now!

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:07.820
Go!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:09.770
I did it!

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.300
A huge success!

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.490
How are you doing, Pauline-san?

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.860
Dance, droplets!

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.860
Surge as hot as a passionate heart!

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:20.530
That's amazing! It's just 
like you said, Mile-chan!

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.040
With water magic, 
practical applications are best.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.120
Being able to make hot water 
is convenient in a lot of ways.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.300
You really do know all kinds of things.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:31.800
Uh... Um... They're secret 
family techniques.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.040
Really?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.830
I'm gonna practice a little more.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:35.650
So will I.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:36.860
I see.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:38.640
Good luck!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.240
Oh! You surprised me!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:43.420
Since you're a swordswoman, 
Mavis-san, let's go over there...

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:48.860
That was a little unexpected.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.490
What was?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:54.240
That you would just accept 
Mile-chan's suggestion.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:58.620
She might be a mass of mysteries, 
but her advice is right on point.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:02.000
She used that search magic earlier, too.
 Her skills are the real deal.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:07.450
<i>If everyone gets stronger, 
I'll stand out less.</i>

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:09.760
<i>And by completing the quest, 
it's two birds with one stone!</i>

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:16.560
Now, I'll start at a normal person's speed 
and gradually start coming at you faster.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.030
Mavis-san, I'd like you to 
deflect all of my strikes.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:20.890
All right.

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:22.200
Here I come.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:22.940
Take this!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.110
Whoa!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.190
I can handle this much, no problem!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.570
Then I'll increase to 1.2x speed!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.820
Y-You got any more?

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.320
1.5x speed!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.200
I-I'm barely keeping up...

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.540
20x speed!

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:43.290
Wait! Did your eyes and voice just change?

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.270
I'm so sorry! I started just having fun!

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:54.320
Mile...

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:54.930
Yes?

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:57.080
You're amazing! Amazing!

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.310
I didn't know humans could move so fast!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:02.060
One day, I, too, would like 
to reach such heights!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:05.000
Mile, please train me more!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.360
Mavis-san...

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:07.930
All right!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.610
I'll use every means I 
know of to make you stronger!

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:19.290
First, you must put on this hachimaki.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:23.290
<b>She Starts with Form First</b>

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:23.290
Why are you dressed like that?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.420
Never mind that. Put it on.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.540
<b>Lots of Things Mixed Together</b>

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:32.550
If the hachimaki touches 
the ground, you start over!

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.720
Don't rest. Keep up a constant pace.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.840
Strike at a speed where 
you can't feel the heat.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:46.920
I have no idea what they're doing, 
but that's some impressive training.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.520
Yes, it is.

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:53.600
We should start setting up camp soon.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:54.530
Yes, we should.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.530
First...

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.850
A tent!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:02.790
Firewood!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.500
All that's left is food... Food...

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:08.590
Orc meat!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.000
Well, should we have dinner—

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:11.980
Huh?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.680
To think you can use storage magic, too.

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:19.280
You're quite the valuable commodity—

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.680
No. I mean, if people found out about this,

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.890
there'd be no end to the invitations you'd get.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.980
Don't you dare tell anyone.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.400
I got some very good training today,
 thanks to Mile.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.400
With this, even those horned rabbits will...

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.650
I forgot. My sword is...

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.490
If that's all, let me see it.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.700
First, I'll bury it in the ground.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:46.440
<i>Carbon content, titanium, 
high tensile steel...</i>

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:49.930
<i>plus a lot of other things to make 
a sword that won't ever break.</i>

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:52.320
<i>In terms of keenness, it will be around 
the fifth-sharpest in this world.</i>

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:54.600
<i>The edge won't chip. It will 
resist blood and grease.</i>

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.790
<i>It will be a useful sword that 
doesn't require maintenance.</i>

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.600
<i>But it will look just like it used to.</i>

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.350
Mile Blizzard!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.440
Here you go, Mavis-san.

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.690
You can fix swords too, Mile? 
You really are amazing.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:24.090
How does burying a broken 
sword in the ground fix it?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.700
I-I-It's...

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.730
A secret family technique. Right?

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:29.820
Yes. Yes!

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:32.210
Well, whatever.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.020
<i>The storage magic earlier is the same.</i>

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.220
<i>This will be useful in business.</i>

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.980
It's amazingly sharp!

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.380
Thank you, Mile!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.020
All right! I've cornered it!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.820
Got it! That makes ten!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:56.920
We've completed our assignment!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.780
We cleared it, thanks to Mile.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.040
No, no. I really didn't do anything.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.180
Too much humility is just 
another form of bragging.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.290
It was my pleasure.

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:08.700
Now, let's get back.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.220
If we don't return today, we'll fail.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:14.660
What was that?

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.360
A rock golem!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.800
If I remember correctly...

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:25.240
A group of four C ranks can 
barely beat that monster!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.680
At our current level, we don't 
stand a chance! We have to run!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.190
Mile!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.920
<i>What is that?</i>

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.320
<i>How does it move?</i>

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.190
<i>What's the power source? Where's the engine?</i>

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.480
<i>What's the armor made of?</i>

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:42.610
<i>It's truly a wonder of 
otherworldly mechanisms!</i>

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:48.990
<i>I want to pop it apart and 
investigate every inch of it!</i>

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.720
Mile-chan!

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:51.920
Is she trembling?

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.760
So even Mile is afraid of rock golems?

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.000
They're behind us, too?

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.380
We don't have a choice.

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.220
Let's go, Reina! Pauline!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:09.220
Before the ones back there reach us,
 we'll break past the one ahead!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.930
We have no other options.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.280
Oh no!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.540
I won't let you!

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:25.450
There!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:29.410
Take this!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.480
Uh-oh!

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:35.420
Reina-san!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.670
Over here!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.490
Focus your thoughts...

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.170
Rapid fire!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.250
That got through!

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:47.600
Aim for the joints, Mavis!

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:48.850
Got it!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:54.810
Now!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.940
Mile! We're running... away?

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:01.190
As I thought. This was built 
up using magnetic force, right?

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.960
You might even be able to 
make this configuration!

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.810
I'm just not surprised by her anymore.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.540
I will now announce the 
results of the assignment.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.540
Squad A, elimination of big rats...

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.020
Failure.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:17.080
<b>Depressed</b>

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:17.080
Squad B, elimination of 
fire-breathing toads...

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:18.100
Failure.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:18.630
<b>Depressed</b>

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:21.760
Squad C, elimination of ten horned rabbits...

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.580
Success.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:27.800
Additionally, they crushed three rock golems 
they encountered while on the quest.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:29.740
What?!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.310
<i>This party could really make it!</i>

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.570
<i>Assignment cleared!</i>

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:37.150
<i>Wait! Are we standing out?</i>

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.860
<i>Still...</i>

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.080
<i>New companions...</i>

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.820
<i>New friends...</i>

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:53.550
Everyone made it out safely?

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:54.950
Thank you very much.

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:57.570
We owe it all to you, Arledy-sama.

00:21:57.570 --> 00:21:58.930
I know this is sudden,

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:02.110
but I've discovered the location 
of the three who wrecked my plans,

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:04.710
as well as the little kitten.

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.220
Really?

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.900
Just you wait, Mile.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.970
Didn't I Say to Make My Abilities 
Average in the Next Life?!
